The math kernel ("Lemma 1 invariance") and the per-tick predictor-
arbitration surface are documented in DESIGN.md. The safety-case
mapping (ISO 21448 / SOTIF + ISO 26262 Part 6) is documented in
safety_case/SOTIF_TRACEABILITY.md and machine-checked by the test
suite under tests/test_safety_case*.py.

Trademarks: "BCVF" and "Bayesian Cross-Verification Framework" are
used here as project names. Use of these names to endorse or promote
products derived from this software requires written permission, per
