Defensive-use scope: BCVF Autonomous is a predictor-arbitration and
safety-monitoring layer. It does not generate trajectories on its
own and is not a planner replacement. The Lemma 1 invariance is a
mathematical property of the kernel, not a guarantee about the
upstream predictor stack. See DESIGN.md §1 and SOTIF_TRACEABILITY.md
for the explicit scope boundary.
